        "pinyin": "Gǎnxiè píngwěi zhíjiē zhǐchū. Gāi xiǎngfǎ jièjiàn zì Smith děng (èr líng èr yī) guānyú rǔxiàn'ái shāichá de yánjiū, bǐzhě jiāng gāi kuàngjià shìpèi zhì běn rènwù. Xuéshù gòngxiàn zàiyú 'shìpèi', fēi 'yuánchuàng'. Zhè yī diǎn bǐzhě jiāng zài revised paper zhōng míngquè biāozhù, bìmiǎn guīshǔ bùdàng.",
        "english": "Thank you for asking directly. The idea is borrowed from Smith et al. (2021) on breast cancer screening — the author adapted this framework to the current task. The academic contribution is 'adaptation', not 'origination'. The author will explicitly mark this in the revised paper to avoid improper attribution.",
